  ],
  "_race_sets": "Race gear sets (design/gdd/race-gear-sets.md 3.5-3.10, Boss 2026-11-13; built by tools/items/build_race_gear.py). kind race: 5 pieces (the race weapon of the class + shirt, pants, armband, shoes). The set option works only when the card's race equals `race`; steps boost the race passive with cell_mod words (logic/race_sets.gd). A step's numbers x tier_mul of the LOWEST tier among the N best pieces it counts (white starter 0.75, PO default). bonuses stays empty: ItemCatalog.set_bonus ignores race sets."
